; WIDE GAZE NETWORKS, the Naga's rank-I Unique tech system (SP2 Task 2, design rulings 10-13). The
; ms_o_trickery shape: two invades as plain entries in the card's order, each in its own usage group.
; The third action is Hypnotize's clear, SITUATIONAL (it appears on the Hypnotized TARGET's bar
; through can_be_used_situationally_by, and ActionSystemClearBuff hides it from the Kit's tooltip).
; The one passive is the ALWAYS-ON aura that carries Hypnotize's targeting rule to the Naga and its
; allies (ruling 12). system_tags = 1 is UNIQUE. SP5: the Kit's own bare glyph (a three-node gaze
; network), distinct from Ping's and Hypnotize's own named families - decided 2026-09-23 that the
; two invades draw SEPARATE pictures.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("1_action")]([ExtResource("4_ping"), ExtResource("5_hypnotize"), ExtResource("6_clear")])
passives = Array[ExtResource("3_passive")]([ExtResource("7_aura")])
sp_cost = 2
system_tags = 1
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckrv6mvs5q65e"
icon_override = ExtResource("8_icon")
